stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: Employee reports a\nfailure/action (Asset.ReportAction)
    [*] --> New: Admin creates a work\norder directly (WorkOrder.Manage)

    Draft --> Rejected: Admin Rejects\n(reason recorded)
    Draft --> SentToVendor: Admin Accepts\n(vendor auto-resolved from\nactive Service contract)
    New --> SentToVendor: Admin Sends to Vendor\n(vendor chosen from active\nService contract(s))

    SentToVendor --> FixedPending: Vendor submits Fix report\n(description, cost, parts,\ncompletion date, attachments)
    SentToVendor --> Blocked: Vendor submits Block\n(categorized reason + detail)

    Blocked --> SentToVendor: Admin Resends\n(same vendor, block\nfields cleared)

    FixedPending --> Closed: Admin Confirms fix\n(ClosedDate stamped)

    Rejected --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of SentToVendor
        Vendor resolved only from
        Contract.ContractType == "Service"
        active on the asset. Zero
        matching contracts blocks
        Accept/SendToVendor.
    end note
